WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:05,110
Okay, senior, are you going to touch the box today? I'm a little scared

2
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:08,650
Go ahead, don't be afraid

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:11,650
Don’t we have a mutant pharmaceutical industry? Even if something really happens

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:18,970
We can also use mutated pharmaceutical industry to become a good man, right?

5
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:24,410
Senior, look at this. I turned it over yesterday and forgot to tell you.

6
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:26,410
Hunters are stronger than survivors

7
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,410
They will find you and kill you

8
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,410
They won't make friends with you

9
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,410
You are just prey in their eyes

10
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:34,410
The images of hunters are ever-changing

11
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:36,410
Maybe he's a Tyrannosaurus rex or maybe a wolf

12
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:40,660
Of course, if you can kill a powerful hunter as a prey

13
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,660
You can also get Hunter's Chest
